# Git holds the framework only: the command, the template, notes and the script.
# All podcast content stays local.

# Personal sources files (CONTENT, goals, current questions). Keep only the template.
sources/*
!sources/_template.md

# Everything a run creates: settings, profiles, notes, transcripts, digests, scripts,
# NotebookLM files, mp3 episodes, feeds and logs. Keep only the script that makes them.
podcast-digest/*
!podcast-digest/podcast
